cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GENEB, please cite the ICML 2026 paper below."
title: "GENEB: Genomic Embedding Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for choosing genomic foundation models. GENEB evaluates frozen
  representations from 40 genomic foundation models on 100 DNA classification
  tasks across 13 functional categories, under a single probing protocol, in
  full-data, 10-shot and 1-shot regimes.
type: software
